# PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Implement **AG-004 Tool Manager & Tool Registry** as a production-grade subsystem.

AG-004 must provide the infrastructure required for agents to safely discover, authorize, validate, execute, monitor and audit tools.

The target architecture is:

```text
                    ┌──────────────────────┐
                    │       AG-001         │
                    │ Master Orchestrator  │
                    └──────────┬───────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌──────────────────────┐
                    │       AG-004         │
                    │   Tool Manager       │
                    └──────────┬───────────┘
                               │
              ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
              ▼                ▼                ▼
       Tool Registry      Authorization     Validator
              │                │                │
              └────────────────┼────────────────┘
                               ▼
                        Tool Executor
                               │
                    ┌──────────┼──────────┐
                    ▼          ▼          ▼
                 Result     Metrics     Audit
```

The system must support future real tools such as:

* HTTP/API tools
* search tools
* calculator tools
* filesystem tools
* database tools
* payment tools
* email tools
* browser tools
* project-management tools
* internal application tools

BUT DO NOT implement dangerous or external integrations unnecessarily in this sprint.

Sprint 16 should establish the **secure tool-management foundation and runtime execution architecture**.

