# PHASE 10 — TIMEOUT & CANCELLATION

Tool execution must support:

* timeout
* AbortSignal/cancellation
* cleanup
* deterministic timeout errors

Do not allow a timed-out execution to incorrectly report success.

Pay special attention to race conditions.

Test:

```text
success vs timeout
success vs cancellation
timeout vs cancellation
failure vs timeout
```

The result must always reflect the actual winning execution state.

